WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.806
Welcome to the British Council 
Learning Hub

00:00:06.826 --> 00:00:09.360
We're here to get you started

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.160
and show you where to get help 
if you need it

00:00:13.327 --> 00:00:14.120
Step 1

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:16.800
The Learning Hub works best
with the most recent

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.298
version of Google Chrome

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:21.040
Activities work best on a

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.200
Laptop, PC or Mac

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:27.160
But don't worry if your child
uses a table or a phone

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.160
They'll still be able to complete 
the activities

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.720
It's just that the experience 
vis better

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.080
on a larger screen

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.040
Step 2

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.773
You will receive a welcome to the
Learning Hub email

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.520
inviting you to setup your
child's account

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.800
Click on the button or link to
create a password

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.800
Oh and keep this email safe

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.633
You may need to refer to it again 
in the future

00:00:50.047 --> 00:00:51.320
Step 3

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.118
You will be taken to this page

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.480
where we will ask you to create
a password

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:58.480
Choose something memorable
to you and your child

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:01.480
Using a mix of upper and 
lowercase letters

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.953
Enter the new password twice
and press submit

00:01:06.854 --> 00:01:07.840
Step 4

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:09.320
Now let's logon

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.320
At the bottom of your welcome
to the Learning Hub email

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:13.840
You will find

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.120
the web address for your child's
Learning hub

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.880
your child's username

00:01:19.181 --> 00:01:20.200
Step 5

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.960
Click on the web address

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:24.120
This will take you to your child's 
Learning Hub 

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.120
or either Primary Plus or 
Secondary Plus

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.240
Whichever course your child
is registered on

00:01:29.673 --> 00:01:31.880
Now enter your child's username

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.840
and the password you have created

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:39.720
Now you're logged on your child
can access their course modules

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.360
Excellent work!

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.760
Don't worry if you forget your 
password we all do

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:47.760
Just click lost password on the
home page

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.960
and follow the instructions
on screen

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:53.160
So this is where you will need to
use your child's username

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.880
Copy it from your welcome to
the Learning Hub email

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.440
Paste it in the box on the lost
password page

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:05.307
Follow the security check and
reset your password

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:09.920
If you have any problems on the
Learning Hub

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.920
We have a special team of people
to help you

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:14.480
Do not worry

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.480
and what's more you can write
to them in your own language

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:18.960
they will understand

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.920
Simply hit the help button

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.920
By the way it's better to 
use the help button

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.360
Rather than calling or emailing us

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.480
Choose what you're having 
a problem with

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:32.480
Then type your email address the one 
you used to register for the course

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:35.480
Add a brief descriptiom of what's wrong

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:39.080
Don't forget you can write to us in your
own language

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:44.400
Our team will respond in less that
one minute via email

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:48.280
They will reply in English so we 
recommend using Google Translate

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.520
to translate the text

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.040
if you prefer to read in your own
language

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.800
So check your email

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:56.480
We will have sent instructions
to solve the problem

00:02:57.377 --> 00:03:02.280
If you still need help reply to the email 
our support team will give you more help

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:09.280
It's best to join the live classes using
a laptop, PC or Mac

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:12.000
The live classes will be listed here

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.560
If your child is joining a live class

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.920
It's a good idea to follow this checklist

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:20.587
Ensure your child is in a quiet place
with no distractions

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:24.000
Log on to the Learning Hub a few
minutes in advance

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.160
Check your internet connection

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.800
Check your tech

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:30.320
We recommend you search for
zoom test

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:33.320
and follow the instructions 
on screen

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:36.000
When it's time simply click join

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:39.160
and your child will enter 
a waiting room

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:42.840
The teacher will check the identity
of your child using their first name

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:45.840
and the first letter of their
last name

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.840
Once the checks are complete the
teacher will start the live class

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.960
Remember if you have problems 
with this

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.480
click the help button and follow
the steps we just covered

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:59.480
To help you log on to the Learning
Hub easily

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:03.560
It's a good idea to bookmark the British 
Council Learning Hub website

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.520
You do it like this

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.960
Click the star on the address bar

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.480
then click save

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:12.920
Child protection is so important 
to us

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:17.520
To keep everyone safe and to ensure
everyone feels valued and comfortable

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.480
We have some golden rules that we
ask all students to follow

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:24.480
Find them in our code 
of conduct section

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:29.520
If your child forgets their password
just before class

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:32.520
and you are not available to reset it

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:36.000
a member of staff at the teaching
centre will be able to help

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.280
For this reason we recommend 

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:42.360
that your child has the British Council
teaching centre phone number to hand

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.960
Just in case

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.960
And that's it your're all set to go

00:04:47.787 --> 00:04:49.122
Watch our other videos

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:52.091
to find out what your child will
be doing on the Learning Hub

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.891
Bye!

